    <bpmn:process id="W_W3793" name="W3793. Sourcing Agent Selection, Contracting &amp; Performance Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sourcing-model decision (W3787); agent contract cycle
Frequency: Per selection + ongoing
Volume: Sourcing-agent portfolio (where agent model chosen)
Owner: Global Sourcing / Procurement
Participants: Global Sourcing, Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Finance (links to VS-17.4), ABC (links to VS-86.3), Quality (links to VS-31), Data Privacy (links to VS-91), Compliance (links to VS-22)
Source: workflow W3793 — Sourcing Agent Selection, Contracting &amp; Performance Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3793_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3793_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3793_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
