    <bpmn:process id="W_W3794" name="W3794. Overseas Buying Office Strategy, Establishment &amp; Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sourcing-model decision (W3787); volume threshold
Frequency: Per establishment + ongoing
Volume: Overseas buying office/representative (where office model chosen)
Owner: Global Sourcing / Legal / HR
Participants: Global Sourcing, Legal (links to VS-100.3), HR (links to VS-19/VS-103), Finance (links to VS-17.4/VS-18/VS-72), Tax (links to VS-79), Compliance (links to VS-22/VS-86), IT (links to VS-27)
Source: workflow W3794 — Overseas Buying Office Strategy, Establishment &amp; Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3794_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3794_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
