      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3794_Task4" name="Global Sourcing/Legal/Finance establish the overseas buying office (where the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing/Legal/Finance establish the overseas buying office (where the office model is chosen): country selection, legal-entity/representative-office structure (links to VS-100.3/VS-36), tax/transfer-pricing (links to VS-79/VS-72), staffing model (expat/local — links to VS-19/VS-103), and budget
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Legal / Finance / HR
Accountable (A): CEO / Board (links to VS-36)
Duration: On establishment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3794_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3794_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3794_Task5" name="Global Sourcing/HR operate the overseas office: staff hiring/management (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Global Sourcing/HR operate the overseas office: staff hiring/management (links to VS-19/VS-103), governance and reporting to HQ, systems/IT (links to VS-27), and integration to BuildRight&#x27;s global-sourcing and merchandising processes
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / HR / IT
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3794_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3794_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3794_Task6" name="Global Sourcing/Finance measure overseas-office ROI (savings, vendor-base…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Global Sourcing/Finance measure overseas-office ROI (savings, vendor-base value, control improvement, overhead) vs the agent/direct alternatives (links to W3808) and recommend continuation/expansion/consolidation
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3794_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3794_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3794_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
