        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-596 (ensure controlled execution — Sourcing Agent, Overseas Buying Office &amp; Import Vendor Management (PA-122.2).) | - operational: ROI threshold and model review (links to W3787); operational: governance and reporting
Owner: Global Sourcing / Legal / HR</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
