    <bpmn:process id="W_W3795" name="W3795. Import Vendor Onboarding, Qualification &amp; Master Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sourcing decision; new import vendor
Frequency: Per vendor + maintained
Volume: ~400 international vendors
Owner: Global Sourcing / Vendor Management
Participants: Global Sourcing, Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Quality (links to VS-31), Customs (links to VS-87), AML (links to VS-86), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Master Data (links to VS-29)
Source: workflow W3795 — Import Vendor Onboarding, Qualification &amp; Master Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3795_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3795_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3795_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3795_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3795_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3795_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3795_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3795_Start3" name="Sourcing decision; new import vendor">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3795_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3795_Task4" name="Global Sourcing/Vendor-Mgmt onboard and qualify import vendors: legal/financial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing/Vendor-Mgmt onboard and qualify import vendors: legal/financial due diligence, sanctions/restricted-party screening (links to VS-86), trade-compliance and country-of-origin validation (links to VS-87), factory capability audit (links to VS-31/W160/W1546), and capacity/lead-time/MOQ capture — extending the onboarding discipline of VS-03.1 with import-specific qualification
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Quality / Customs
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3795_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3795_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3795_Task5" name="Global Sourcing/Master-Data establish and maintain the import vendor master…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Global Sourcing/Master-Data establish and maintain the import vendor master record (links to VS-29/W402): country, Incoterms, currency, payment terms, lead time, certifications (links to VS-117), agent/office linkage, and compliance status; integrate to ERP/vendor portal (links to VS-03.4)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Master Data / IT
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per vendor + maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3795_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3795_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3795_Task6" name="Global Sourcing/Compliance maintain vendor re-qualification (periodic…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Global Sourcing/Compliance maintain vendor re-qualification (periodic financial/compliance/factory re-audit links to W1546) and manage offboarding/replacement of import vendors
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Compliance / Quality
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3795_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3795_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3795_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
