        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-71 (ensure import sourcing &amp; social-compliance verification.) | - operational: qualification gate; operational: master governance
Owner: Global Sourcing / Vendor Management</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
