      <bpmn:userTask id="W3800_Task4" name="Global Sourcing/ABC manage anti-bribery and conflict-of-interest risk in…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing/ABC manage anti-bribery and conflict-of-interest risk in overseas sourcing: agent/staff due diligence (links to W3793/W3794), gifts/entertainment and facilitation-payment controls, COI disclosure for sourcing staff, and third-party-intermediary screening (links to VS-86.3)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / ABC / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising / CEO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
