      <bpmn:userTask id="W3800_Task5" name="Global Sourcing/Audit run import-sourcing controls testing and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Global Sourcing/Audit run import-sourcing controls testing and overseas-office/agent audits (links to VS-21.3/W353), manage findings, and verify agent invoices/commissions for irregularity
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Audit / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Annual + on event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3800_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3800_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3800_Task6" name="Global Sourcing/Speak-Up ensure overseas sourcing channels have access to the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Global Sourcing/Speak-Up ensure overseas sourcing channels have access to the speak-up channel (links to VS-119), investigate allegations, and report ABC/sourcing-integrity posture to audit/governance (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Speak-Up / Audit
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising / CEO
Duration: On event + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3800_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
